---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Routes
permalink: /routes/
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h1>Route Guide</h1>
      <p>Bouldering (V-scale) to roped (YDS) grade conversion — rough, but useful for picking your first project.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grade-chart" style="max-width:36rem; margin:0 auto;">
      {% for g in grades.list %}
      <div class="grade-row">
        <span class="grade-row__label">{{ g.label }}</span>
        <span class="grade-row__bar"><span class="grade-row__bar-fill" style="width:{{ g.fill }}%; background:{{ g.color }};"></span></span>
        <span class="grade-row__yds">{{ g.yds }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="prose" style="text-align:center; margin-top:2.5rem; opacity:0.8;">
      Routes are reset every two weeks. Color tape at the base of each route marks
      its grade band — ask a staff member on the floor if you're not sure what
      you're looking at.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
